 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The location suffix",
     "texto": [
      "**-da/-de/-ta/-te** means «in» or «at». It is added to the end of the noun: **evde** (at home), **okulda** (at school).",
      "The vowel matches the last vowel of the noun. After voiceless consonants such as **k, p, t, ç, f, h, s, ş**, the d changes to t: **parkta** (in the park).",
      "**Nerede?** = where? **Nerede çalışıyorsun?** = where do you work?"
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
